      "id": "claim_937b0d08bd3849b4b3ddd56a5664ca43",
      "statement": "The Go server entrypoint constructs four independent ZeroHub instances (static, random, IP, permanent hub types) via a shared newZeroHubOrPanic constructor and passes them to the handler, so each hub type is backed by its own hub registry.",
