    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2c43b5311acc47ee9d484447edca9b51",
      "statement": "The Go signaling server validates hub-endpoint query parameters before the WebSocket handshake: a missing or empty id parameter and any non-JSON hubMetadata or peerMetadata are rejected with HTTP 400, so an empty-id request can no longer create a junk hub under the empty-string key and malformed metadata is not stored or re-broadcast.",
